    <statement><p>Evaluate the double integral <m>\displaystyle
\iint_D \! x^{5} \, dA,</m>
where <m>D = \lbrace(x,y) : 1 \le x \le e, 0 \le y \le \ln x\rbrace</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1}{6}\mathopen{}\left(\frac{5}{6}e^{6}+\frac{1}{6}\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
